      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Acute aortic dissection is a rare medical emergency accompanied by high mortality. For ensuring fast diagnosis and delivery of appropriate medical treatment the knowledge of signs and symptoms is crucial. Here we summarize clinical presentation according to existing studies, focus on diagnosis and introduce to contemporary treatment of this disease."},
